docs {
  # Clinical Co-Pilot API collection

  Run top to bottom (or "Run collection"). Requests 3-6 establish the
  session and capture the CSRF token and facts hash into variables.

  1. Health            liveness, no auth
  2. Ready             dependency probes, no auth, cached 60s
  3. Login page        starts the OpenEMR session
  4. Login             authenticates (admin by default)
  5. Open chart        sets the session patient; captures csrf_token
  6. Brief             the verified briefing; captures facts_hash
  7. Ask               a follow-up question, verified
  8. Ask (stale hash)  chart_changed: true
  9. Brief without CSRF -> refused. For the ACL refusal, set user/password
     to receptionist/receptionist and re-run 3-6 (6 returns 403).

  Select the `local` or `vps` environment. Cookies are handled by Bruno
  automatically. The patient id is set via the OpenEMR session (request 4);
  a pid in the chat body is ignored by design.
}
